  "bio": "Gogutti is a fineline tattoo artist based in Wroclaw, Poland, who is highly skilled in creating intricate vegan-friendly tattoos. Their artistry not only captures the delicate balance of fine lines but also embodies a unique blend of poetry and life's essence in each design, ensuring a personalized and meaningful tattoo experience for every client.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Wroclaw, Woj. Dolnośląskie, Poland\n\nSztuka ulicy w mrocznej piwnicy .\nSzczecin\nTatuaze",
